<div class="lab-draft" data-lab-draft>
  <div class="draft-row">
    <div><strong>本机草稿</strong><p data-draft-status role="status">填写后自动保存到此浏览器。</p></div>
    <details class="draft-tools" data-draft-actions hidden>
      <summary class="focus-ring">草稿操作</summary>
      <div class="draft-actions">
      <button class="focus-ring" type="button" data-draft-save>立即保存</button>
      <button class="focus-ring" type="button" data-draft-restore disabled>恢复已保存草稿</button>
      <button class="focus-ring" type="button" data-draft-forget title="只删除本机草稿，不清空当前表格">删除本机草稿</button>
      </div>
      <p class="draft-note">保存实验参数、小组代号与表格；删除草稿不清空当前表格。设备连接与未填入表格的采集记录不保存。</p>
    </details>
  </div>
  <div class="draft-conflict" data-draft-conflict hidden>
    <p>另一标签页已修改或删除此实验的草稿。自动保存已暂停，请选择要保留的内容。</p>
    <button class="focus-ring" type="button" data-draft-load-other>载入已保存草稿</button>
    <button class="focus-ring" type="button" data-draft-keep-current>用当前表格保存</button>
  </div>
  <noscript><p>自动保存需要启用 JavaScript。</p></noscript>
</div>
<style>
  .lab-draft{background:#eef7ff;border-bottom:1px solid #b7dcff;padding:16px 24px;color:#102033}
  .draft-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  strong{font-size:14px;font-weight:650}p{margin:5px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;color:#475569}
  .draft-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .draft-tools{position:relative}
  summary{cursor:pointer;font-size:12px;min-height:44px;padding:12px;border-radius:6px;color:#074f9f}
  .draft-tools[open]{flex-basis:100%}
  button{cursor:pointer;min-height:44px;border:1px solid #b7dcff;background:white;color:#074f9f;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px}
  button:hover{background:#d8ecff}button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:default}
  .draft-note{margin-top:10px}.draft-conflict{padding:12px;border:1px solid #f4a51c;background:#fffbeb;margin-top:12px}
  .draft-conflict button{margin:10px 8px 0 0}
  @media(max-width:640px){.lab-draft{padding:14px 16px}.draft-actions{gap:6px}button{padding:8px 10px}}
</style>
